<h2>X-Ray</h2>
<ul><li>Active tracing: Lambda + API Gateway + DynamoDB instrumentation</li></ul>
<h2>DR strategy</h2>
<ul><li>Pattern: backup-restore / pilot-light / warm-standby / active-active</li><li>Region pair: us-east-1 → us-west-2</li><li>RTO: hours</li><li>RPO: hours</li><li>Drill cadence: quarterly</li></ul>
